{"id":"vod_sn_37816","vodId":"37816","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"放学后的昴星团","name_cn":"放学后的昴星团","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/436fa03dc79171d87d5e77e1105f5bae.jpg"},"summary":"昂（高森奈津美 配音）是一名平凡的中学生，非常喜欢星星。一天，她竟然遇到了因为宇宙飞船故障而落难在地球的普勒阿得斯星人。普勒阿得斯星人希望昂能够帮助它收集引擎碎片，以此来修理宇宙飞船返回故乡。然而，本来只需要借一人之力便可以完成的任务，不知道为什么变成了五人。　　个性大大咧咧有些像男孩子的葵（大桥步夕 配音）、温文尔雅永远都是笑眯眯的树（立野香菜子 配音）、活泼好动运动神经发达的光（牧野由衣 配音）、沉默寡言外冷内热的七子（藤田咲 配音），除了昂外，帮助普勒阿得斯星人的还有另外四名女孩。可是，这五个人凑在一起，却总有一种不协调的感觉，究竟是哪里出了问题呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k7ZwQTHwHd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gs14a0G40i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FdtMCBgkct1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JJaqj4nHWH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uMnfLBkrpd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GkmVEKW43A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b3LraD1ELi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dmJmkWtAs91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yRkMdnkx6E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eHZCVcWXpF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mNwuLFjY8P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QfNiPVhU3r1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:06.334Z"}